            <h1>About Us</h1>
            <p>Welcome to [ Blood Bank ]! We are a nonprofit organization dedicated to providing life-saving blood to patients in need. Since our founding in [Year], we have been working to ensure that blood donations are always available for those who require them, whether for surgery, trauma recovery, or chronic conditions.</p>

            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>Our mission is to save lives by ensuring a steady, reliable supply of safe blood for hospitals, clinics, and patients across the region. We strive to educate the public on the importance of blood donation and foster a community that comes together to support those in need.</p>

            <h2>Why Donate Blood?</h2>
            <p>Every two seconds, someone in the world needs a blood transfusion. One donation can save up to three lives. By donating blood, you're giving someone a second chance at life, whether it's a car accident survivor, someone undergoing surgery, or a patient with a blood disorder. Your contribution matters!</p>

            <h2>How It Works</h2>
            <p>Donating blood is a simple and safe process. Here’s what you can expect:</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Registration: Fill out a brief health questionnaire.</li>
                <li>Blood Donation: The donation takes about 10-15 minutes.</li>
                <li>Post-Donation Care: Relax and enjoy a snack while you regain your strength!</li>
            </ol>
            <p>Anyone who meets the eligibility requirements can donate. For more details on how to become a donor, visit our <a href="donor.html">Donor Page</a>.</p>

